stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : fee reserved (dang_xu_ly)<br/>balance deducted<br/>transaction recorded

    PENDING --> OTP_SENT : OTP generated & sent via email
    PENDING --> FAILED : OTP Service error<br/>OR service crashed for > 2 minutes<br/>(refund + release fee)

    OTP_SENT --> SUCCESS : correct OTP verified<br/>within 5 minutes
    OTP_SENT --> FAILED : wrong OTP<br/>(max attempts exceeded, HTTP 429)<br/>OR fee confirmation failed<br/>(refund + release fee)
    OTP_SENT --> EXPIRED : OTP not verified<br/>within 5 minutes<br/>(HTTP 410 Gone, refund + release fee)

    SUCCESS --> [*] : fee status = da_thanh_toan<br/>confirmation email sent
    FAILED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]

    note right of SUCCESS
        Final state - triggers:
        - Fee Service: confirm (paid_amount += amount, status = da_thanh_toan)
        - OTP Service -> RabbitMQ: confirmation email event
        (balance was already deducted before PENDING)
    end note

    note right of PENDING
        Before this state, the request can already be rejected
        and NO transaction is recorded:
        - fee already paid / being processed: HTTP 409 (Scenario B)
        - insufficient balance: HTTP 402 (Scenario A)
    end note
